OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed after bus crashes into
OL,4,Apub                                    
OL,6,FA road was closed after a coach crashed
OL,7,Finto a pub in a town in Derbyshire.    
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said it attended the 
OL,10,Fscene of a crash in Butterley Hill,    
OL,11,FRipley, where a bus had struck The     
OL,12,FTalbot Taphouse.                       
OL,14,FThe collision sent rubble and debris   
OL,15,Ffrom the building into the road and    
OL,16,Fcaused extensive damage to the front of
OL,17,Fthe coach. Officers said one person was
OL,18,Ftaken to hospital with injuries not    
OL,19,Fbelieved to be life-threatening or     
OL,20,Flife-altering but there had been no    
OL,21,Freports of anyone else being hurt.     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
